---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="MEP Consultants | Low-Carbon Building Services | Rubix MEP"
  description="MEP consultants delivering low-carbon building services design, RIBA 0 to 7. £120m+ project value across 10 sectors. Discuss your project."
  headerVariant="home"
>
  <!-- migrating logo: hero-centre on load, docks top-left on scroll -->
  <a class="hero-logo" id="heroLogo" href="/" aria-label="Rubix MEP, home" style="--dock:0">
    <img id="heroLogoImg" src="/assets/logo-white-tile-mep.png" alt="Rubix MEP" />
  </a>

  <!-- brand hero: the logo is the page on first view -->
  <section class="brand-hero" id="brandHero">
    <div class="bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="scroll-cue" aria-hidden="true"><span>Scroll</span><span class="line"></span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- rolling clients banner -->
  <section class="marquee-band" aria-label="Clients we work with">
    <div class="lab">We are proud to work with</div>
    <div class="marquee">
      <div class="track" id="clientTrack">
        <img src="/assets/client-national-trust.png" alt="National Trust" />
        <img src="/assets/client-space-group.png" alt="Space Group" />
        <img src="/assets/client-cbre.png" alt="CBRE" />
        <img src="/assets/client-hallmark.png" alt="Hallmark" />
        <img src="/assets/client-lovett-care.jpg" alt="Lovett Care" />
        <img src="/assets/client-grayscourt.png" alt="Grayscourt" />
        <img src="/assets/client-batsford.png" alt="Batsford Arboretum" />
        <img src="/assets/client-met-office.jpg" alt="Met Office" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- intro -->
  <section class="intro">
    <div class="bg" role="img" aria-label="City skyline blended with forest treeline in Rubix navy duotone"></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1 class="disp rv">Low-<span class="c-green">carbon</span> building services design <span class="hl">tailored to your needs.</span></h1>
      <div class="ctas rv rv-d1">
        <a href="#enquire" class="btn btn-primary">Discuss your project <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>
        <a href="/capabilities" class="btn btn-ghost">Download capabilities</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- services pillars -->
  <section class="services">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center rv">
        <span class="kick">What we do</span>
        <h2 class="disp">Four disciplines, one integrated design</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="pillars">
        <a class="pillar rv" style="--accent:var(--navy)" href="/services#mechanical">
          <span class="ico"><img src="/assets/icon-mechanical.png" alt="" /></span>
          <h3 class="disp">Mechanical</h3>
        </a>
        <a class="pillar rv rv-d1" style="--accent:var(--magenta)" href="/services#electrical">
          <span class="ico"><img src="/assets/icon-electrical.png" alt="" /></span>
          <h3 class="disp">Electrical</h3>
        </a>
        <a class="pillar rv rv-d2" style="--accent:var(--blue)" href="/services#public-health">
          <span class="ico"><img src="/assets/icon-public-health.png" alt="" /></span>
          <h3 class="disp">Public Health</h3>
        </a>
        <a class="pillar rv rv-d3" style="--accent:var(--lime)" href="/services#building-physics">
          <span class="ico"><img src="/assets/icon-sustainability.png" alt="" /></span>
          <h3 class="disp">Building Physics</h3>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="diff rv">
        <div class="star" aria-hidden="true">&#9733;</div>
        <div>
          <div class="tag">Our differentiator</div>
          <h3 class="disp">Building Physics</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Building physics is what sets us apart: understanding how a building performs before it is built, so low-<span class="c-green">carbon</span> decisions are made early, where they matter most.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RIBA plan of work -->
  <section class="riba">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="sec-head rv">
        <span class="kick">With you at every stage</span>
        <h2 class="disp">RIBA Plan of Work</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="riba-track rv" id="ribaTrack">
        <div class="riba-stage" tabindex="0">
          <span class="dot">0</span><span class="name">Strategic Definition</span>
          <div class="riba-pop">
            <h4>Stage 0: Strategic Definition</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Business case &amp; sustainability aspirations</li>
              <li>Site energy &amp; infrastructure review</li>
              <li>Early <span class="c-green">carbon</span> benchmarking</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="riba-stage" tabindex="0">
          <span class="dot">1</span><span class="name">Preparation &amp; Briefing</span>
          <div class="riba-pop">
            <h4>Stage 1: Preparation &amp; Briefing</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>MEP project brief &amp; feasibility studies</li>
              <li>Condition &amp; capacity surveys</li>
              <li>Budget cost advice</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="riba-stage" tabindex="0">
          <span class="dot">2</span><span class="name">Concept Design</span>
          <div class="riba-pop">
            <h4>Stage 2: Concept Design</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>MEP servicing strategy</li>
              <li>Low-<span class="c-green">carbon</span> options appraisal</li>
              <li>Plant space &amp; riser allowances</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="riba-stage" tabindex="0">
          <span class="dot">3</span><span class="name">Spatial Coordination</span>
          <div class="riba-pop">
            <h4>Stage 3: Spatial Coordination</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Coordinated MEP layouts</li>
              <li>Thermal modelling &amp; Part L checks</li>
              <li>Planning-stage energy statements</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="riba-stage" tabindex="0">
          <span class="dot">4</span><span class="name">Technical Design</span>
          <div class="riba-pop">
            <h4>Stage 4: Technical Design</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Detailed design &amp; specifications</li>
              <li>Construction-ready drawings</li>
              <li>Tender support</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="riba-stage" tabindex="0">
          <span class="dot">5</span><span class="name">Manufacturing &amp; Construction</span>
          <div class="riba-pop">
            <h4>Stage 5: Manufacturing &amp; Construction</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Site inspections &amp; technical support</li>
              <li>Contractor submittal reviews</li>
              <li>Change management</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="riba-stage" tabindex="0">
          <span class="dot">6</span><span class="name">Handover</span>
          <div class="riba-pop">
            <h4>Stage 6: Handover</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Commissioning witnessing</li>
              <li>O&amp;M documentation review</li>
              <li>Defects &amp; aftercare support</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="riba-stage" tabindex="0">
          <span class="dot">7</span><span class="name">Use</span>
          <div class="riba-pop">
            <h4>Stage 7: Use</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Post-occupancy evaluation</li>
              <li>Energy monitoring &amp; optimisation</li>
              <li>Soft landings support</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="note-ex">Example content shown. Final stage text to be provided.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- sectors: static list (sector pages on hold, items are non-links) -->
  <section class="sectors-band" aria-label="Sectors we cover">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="lab rv">Sectors we cover</div>
      <ul class="sector-list rv rv-d1">
        <li><span class="pip" style="background:var(--navy)"></span>Heritage</li>
        <li><span class="pip" style="background:var(--magenta)"></span>Later Living &amp; Care</li>
        <li><span class="pip" style="background:var(--blue)"></span>Residential</li>
        <li><span class="pip" style="background:var(--lime)"></span>Studios &amp; Media</li>
        <li><span class="pip" style="background:var(--navy)"></span>Education</li>
        <li><span class="pip" style="background:var(--magenta)"></span>Life Sciences</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- featured projects carousel -->
  <section class="projects">
    <div class="head-row rv">
      <div>
        <span class="kick">Proof, not promises</span>
        <h2 class="disp">Featured projects</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="arrows">
        <button class="ctrl" id="prevBtn" aria-label="Previous project">&larr;</button>
        <button class="ctrl" id="nextBtn" aria-label="Next project">&rarr;</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="slides" id="slides">
      <a class="card rv" href="/projects/national-trust-carbon-impact-studies">
        <div class="img">
          <div class="fill" style="background-image:url('/assets/national-trust-photo.jpg')"></div>
          <div class="capsules">
            <span class="capsule">National Trust</span>
            <span class="capsule alt">Heritage</span>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal">
            <h3>Site-wide <span class="c-green">carbon</span> impact studies</h3>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Client</dt><dd>National Trust</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Project</dt><dd>Net zero <span class="c-green">carbon</span> masterplanning across the estate</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Sector</dt><dd>Heritage</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Scope</dt><dd>25+ sites studied UK-wide</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Key fact</dt><dd>Supporting the Trust&rsquo;s 2030 net zero pledge</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <span class="more">View project <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="card rv rv-d1" href="/projects/knowle-retirement-village">
        <div class="img">
          <div class="fill" style="background-image:url('/assets/knowle.jpg')"></div>
          <div class="capsules">
            <span class="capsule">Opus, Knowle</span>
            <span class="capsule alt">Later Living</span>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal">
            <h3>Knowle Retirement Village</h3>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Client</dt><dd>Opus Villages</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Project</dt><dd>New-build retirement village, concept to RIBA Stage 3</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Sector</dt><dd>Later Living &amp; Care</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Value</dt><dd>c. &pound;34.0m</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Key fact</dt><dd>EPC A, net zero energy options appraised</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <span class="more">View project <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="card rv rv-d2" href="/projects/shepperton-studios">
        <div class="img">
          <div class="fill" style="background-image:url('/assets/shepperton-internal.jpg')"></div>
          <div class="capsules">
            <span class="capsule">Shepperton Studios</span>
            <span class="capsule alt">Studios &amp; Media</span>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal">
            <h3>Shepperton Studios</h3>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Client</dt><dd>Space Group</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Project</dt><dd>Food and beverage fit-out across three buildings</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Sector</dt><dd>Studios &amp; Media</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Value</dt><dd>c. &pound;2.0m</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Key fact</dt><dd>RIBA Stage 4 design, BIM Level 2 clash-free model</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <span class="more">View project <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="card rv rv-d3" href="/projects/the-lampworks">
        <div class="img">
          <div class="fill" style="background-image:url('/assets/lampworks-cgi.png')"></div>
          <div class="capsules">
            <span class="capsule">The Lampworks</span>
            <span class="capsule alt">Residential</span>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal">
            <h3>The Lampworks</h3>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Client</dt><dd>Regal ME / Build Fifty5</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Project</dt><dd>148 build-to-rent apartments across five blocks</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Sector</dt><dd>Residential</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Value</dt><dd>c. &pound;23.0m</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Key fact</dt><dd>RIBA Stage 4C construction issue, BIM Level 2</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <span class="more">View project <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- testimonials: short, staggered; full quotes live on the project pages -->
  <section class="social">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head rv">
        <span class="kick">What our clients say</span>
        <h2 class="disp">In their words</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="quotes">
        <a class="quote rv" href="/projects/shepperton-studios">
          <div class="q">&ldquo;Rubix were excellent and are now our go-to MEP designers.&rdquo;</div>
          <div class="by"><b>Chris Lee</b>, Space Group</div>
        </a>
        <a class="quote rv rv-d1 offset" href="/projects/knowle-retirement-village">
          <div class="q">&ldquo;A highly proactive consultancy. They have worked extremely well for us against tight deadlines and kept us well informed at all stages.&rdquo;</div>
          <div class="by"><b>Patrick Egan</b>, Opus Villages</div>
        </a>
        <a class="quote rv rv-d2" href="/projects/national-trust-carbon-impact-studies">
          <div class="q">&ldquo;Thorough, detailed, prompt and at all times highly professional.&rdquo;</div>
          <div class="by"><b>Matthew Knowles</b>, National Trust</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "ProfessionalService",
      "name": "Rubix MEP",
      "description": "MEP consultants delivering low-carbon building services design, RIBA Stages 0 to 7.",
      "url": "https://rubixmep.com/",
      "areaServed": "GB",
      "address": { "@type": "PostalAddress", "streetAddress": "Unit 612/13B, 120 Vyse Street", "addressLocality": "Birmingham", "postalCode": "B18 6NF", "addressCountry": "GB" }
    }
  </script>
  <script is:inline src="/js/home.js" defer></script>
</BaseLayout>
